---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy | 3DPrintingCostCalc.com"
  description="Privacy policy for 3DPrintingCostCalc.com. All 3D files (.stl, .3mf, .gcode) are parsed 100% locally in your browser with zero server uploads."
  breadcrumbs={[
    { name: 'Home', item: 'https://3dprintingcostcalc.com/' },
    { name: 'Privacy Policy', item: 'https://3dprintingcostcalc.com/privacy/' }
  ]}
>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12 space-y-8 text-slate-300">
    <div class="space-y-2">
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-white tracking-tight">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 font-mono">Effective Date: October 2026</p>
    </div>

    <!-- Highlight Box -->
    <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-cyan-950/40 border border-cyan-500/30 text-xs sm:text-sm text-cyan-200 leading-relaxed">
      <strong>Core Privacy Guarantee:</strong> 3DPrintingCostCalc.com is a 100% stateless client-side web utility. When you drop or select a 3D model file (.stl, .3mf, .gcode, .bgcode, or .obj), the file is read and processed entirely inside your local browser memory using JavaScript Web APIs. <strong>No 3D models, CAD geometries, or G-code toolpaths are ever uploaded to our servers, Cloudflare Workers, or any third party.</strong>
    </div>

    <section class="space-y-3 text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white">1. Information We Do Not Collect</h2>
      <p>
        Because our service requires no user registration or accounts, we do not collect personal names, home addresses, phone numbers, passwords, or payment details. Your custom inputs, local electricity rates, and printer presets are stored exclusively in your own browser's <code>localStorage</code> or encoded in shareable URL query parameters.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="space-y-3 text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white">2. Cookies and Web Analytics</h2>
      <p>
        We may use standard web analytics (such as Cloudflare Web Analytics or Google Analytics) to monitor aggregate traffic trends, such as page views, country of origin, and browser types, without collecting personally identifiable information (PII). Cloudflare Web Analytics does not track individual visitors across sites or use stateful client-side cookies for profiling.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="space-y-3 text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white">3. Advertising & Third-Party Cookies</h2>
      <p>
        When advertising services (such as Google AdSense) are active, third-party vendors may use cookies or web beacons to serve ads based on your prior visits to this website or other websites on the Internet. You can opt out of personalized advertising by visiting Google's Ads Settings (<a href="https://adssettings.google.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-cyan-400 underline">https://adssettings.google.com</a>) or via <a href="https://www.aboutads.info" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-cyan-400 underline">www.aboutads.info</a>.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="space-y-3 text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white">4. Affiliate Disclosure</h2>
      <p>
        3DPrintingCostCalc.com may include links to 3D printing filaments, hardware tools, or manufacturing services. If you make a purchase through these links, we may receive a small referral commission at no additional cost to you.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="space-y-3 text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white">5. Contact Information</h2>
      <p>
        If you have any questions or concerns regarding this privacy policy, please contact our support team at <a href="mailto:support@3dprintingcostcalc.com" class="text-cyan-400 underline">support@3dprintingcostcalc.com</a>.
      </p>
    </section>
  </div>
</Layout>
